```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Streamlit / CLI
  participant P as Pipeline
  participant CV as CV Modules
  participant R as Report
  User->>UI: Provide image
  UI->>P: analyze_image(path)
  P->>P: Validate and decode image
  P->>CV: Run quality, color, structure analysis
  CV-->>P: Typed module results
  P->>R: Assemble InspectionReport
  R-->>UI: Report object
  UI-->>User: Metrics, warnings, palette, JSON
```
